      "created_at": "2012-06-09T03:07:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You keep going until you stop getting birds, but it seems like you’re doing something wrong.  The birds you mentioned deal damage during the “Start of Villain Turn” phase.  At the time you’re playing cards, it’s the “Play a Villain Card” phase.  They won’t deal damage until the next turn.</p>",
