      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/cab0a1/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-06-10T08:50:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the birds come “for free” since each one makes you draw another card. The thing is, all the birds do damage at the start of the villain turn. If you have someone like tempest, all birds will die before they do damage…so the only source of damage from the Matriarch is her Brood mother’s revenge power (when a bird is killed she does H-2 damage)</p>",
